prompts.intro:
lipsync to '{text}'


he takes a short breath, then starts speaking. A fitness coach films himself on a phone on a tripod in his gym: static camera, no scene change, no camera cut. He talks with energy and conviction, like a coach recruiting people for a challenge, and his hands move on his key words: open palms toward the lens, counting on his fingers, a short firm chop of the hand, a fist pressed into his open palm; small nods and leans toward the lens between sentences, at natural real-time speed. The gym behind him stays exactly as in the first frame. {voice}

only his voice, no other voices or sounds, strictly as pasted, do not change the text. No subtitles, no captions, no on-screen text

